  "text": "Sour Curry Paste - SD Books\n\nYield: ¼ cup\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nIngredients\n\n10 dried spur chilies (seeded and soaked until tender),\n\n1 tsp sea salt,\n\n2 tbsp mature galangal (finely sliced),\n\n2 tbsp lemongrass (sliced),\n\n⅓ cup shallot (sliced),\n\n1 tbsp shrimp paste.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Process to a smooth paste.",
